tion":false,"start_time":"2026-08-30T04:33:35.828664","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["# Newcastle Urban Observatory — Data Acquisition Notebook\n","\n","**Public real IoT sensor network with open REST API and continuous archive from June 2013 to present.**\n","\n","| Fact | Value |\n","|---|---|\n","| Sensors | 2,128 physical devices |\n","| Broker sources | 29 (Wunderground, AURN, Environment Agency, AQ Mesh, LORA, Building sensors, …) |\n","| Themes | 15 (Air Quality, Traffic, Weather, Noise, Water Quality, Environment, …) |\n","| Variable types | 112 (NO₂, PM₂.₅, PM₁₀, O₃, Temperature, Humidity, Wind, Traffic flow, …) |\n","| Archive depth | June 18, 2013 → live (13+ years continuous) |\n","| API | REST v2 — no authentication required |\n","| Client library | `uo-pyfetch` (returns `pandas` DataFrames) |\n","| Schema | 3 tables: `sensors` → `variables` → `readings` |\n","\n","**Data source for thesis Chapters 3–6.**\n","[API docs](https://api.v2.urbanobservatory.ac.uk/docs/api) ·\n","[Client library](https://api.v2.urbanobservatory.ac.uk/docs/lib) ·\n","[OpenAPI spec](https://api.v2.urbanobservatory.ac.uk/openapi.json)"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":2,"id":"e86269ce","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-30T04:33:35.93881Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-30T04:33:35.937678Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-30T04:33:41.417609Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-30T04:33:41.416004Z"},"papermill":{"duration":5.519929,"end_time":"2026-08-30T04:33:41.420328","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-08-30T04:33:35.900399","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Dataset URL: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/wganme/urban-observatory-results\n"]},{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["  resume-seed: all_experiment_results.csv → 45033 rows\n","  resume-seed: rag_experiment_results.csv → 106664 rows\n","  resume-seed: downloaded from wganme/urban-observatory-results\n","Kaggle environme